# The ruling: other effects that raise the creature's power or toughness still apply. Ornithopter (0/2) gets Giant Growth
# (+3/+3, a 3/5), then Multiply by Zero sets the base to 0/0: it is a 3/3 and lives (layer 7b under 7c). Once the turn ends
# both effects are gone and it is a 0/2 again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Ornithopter
Giant Growth
Multiply by Zero
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Giant Growth.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 3
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Multiply by Zero.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 3
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 3
[T3 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
Bot1.Graveyard = Multiply by Zero; Giant Growth
